BOSS Colossus Start
    Events
        Unit - A unit Is attacked
    Conditions
        (Unit-type of (Attacked unit)) Equal to Colossus (Level 15)
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Owner of (Attacking unit)) Not equal to Neutral Passive
                (Owner of (Attacking unit)) Not equal to Neutral Hostile
    Actions
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Colossus Reset <gen>
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Colossus Dies <gen>
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Colossus Splitting Boulder <gen>
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Colossus Cleaving Attacks Add <gen>
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Colossus Phase 1 Slam <gen>
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Colossus Phase 2 <gen>
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Colossus Phase 3 <gen>
        -------- -----DRAGONS --------
        Trigger - Turn off Emberpeak Dragonfire Flame Strike Colossus <gen>
        Trigger - Turn on Emberpeak Dragonfire Flame Strike Player Units <gen>
        Set VariableSet BossColossus = (Attacked unit)
        Unit Group - Add BossColossus to BOSS
        Wait 0.50 seconds
        Animation - Change BossColossus's animation speed to 30.00% of its original speed
        Animation - Play BossColossus's birth animation
        Sound - Play ColossusReady <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to BossColossus
        Sound - Play RockGolemPissed2 <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to BossColossus
        Wait 5.50 seconds
        Unit - Unpause BossColossus
        Unit - Change ownership of BossColossus to Player 12 (Brown) and Retain color
        Animation - Change BossColossus's animation speed to 100.00% of its original speed
        Animation - Play BossColossus's attack spell animation
        Animation - Queue BossColossus's stand animation
        Sound - Play RockGolemYesAttack2 <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to BossColossus
        Unit - Order BossColossus to Attack Once (Random unit from (Units in DragonFireSpam01 <gen> matching (((Matching unit) belongs to an enemy of Player 12 (Brown).) Equal to True)))
